[[1,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the retaining nuts.</p><p>2. Remove the cover from the housing on the mounting bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244005786.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[1,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>- Fit the relay cover.</p><p>- Tighten the retaining nuts.</p>"],[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the retaining nuts.</p><p>2. Remove the cover from the housing on the mounting bracket.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244002993.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the cover for the EGR valve modulator and the pre-heating control unit.</p><p>Tighten the retaining nuts.</p>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Open the retaining springs (1a) and release the single-acting valve pipe (1b) on the brake servo, undo the fixing nuts (1c).</p><p>2. Remove the protective cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/244002994.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[8,3,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the protective cover in position.</p><p>Tighten the retaining nuts.</p><p>Fit the single-acting valve pipe on the retaining springs.</p>"]]